  "question": {
    "text": "If&nbsp;<math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mi>m</mi></math> and <math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mi>n</mi></math>&nbsp;respectively are the number of local maximum and local minimum points of the function <math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mi>f</mi><mfenced><mi>x</mi></mfenced><mo>=</mo><msubsup><mo>&#8747;</mo><mn>0</mn><msup><mi>x</mi><mn>2</mn></msup></msubsup><mfrac><mrow><msup><mi>t</mi><mn>2</mn></msup><mo>-</mo><mn>5</mn><mi>t</mi><mo>+</mo><mn>4</mn></mrow><mrow><mn>2</mn><mo>+</mo><msup><mi>e</mi><mi>t</mi></msup></mrow></mfrac><mi>d</mi><mi>t</mi></math>, then the ordered pair <math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mfenced><mrow><mi>m</mi><mo>,</mo><mi>n</mi></mrow></mfenced></math> is equal to"
  },
  "options": [
    {
      "text": "<math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mfenced><mrow><mn>2</mn><mo>,</mo><mn>3</mn></mrow></mfenced></math>",
      "is_correct": true
    },
    {
      "text": "<math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mfenced><mrow><mn>3</mn><mo>,</mo><mn>2</mn></mrow></mfenced></math>",
      "is_correct": false
    },
    {
      "text": "<math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mfenced><mrow><mn>2</mn><mo>,</mo><mn>2</mn></mrow></mfenced></math>",
      "is_correct": false
    },
    {
      "text": "<math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mfenced><mrow><mn>3</mn><mo>,</mo><mn>4</mn></mrow></mfenced></math>",
      "is_correct": false
    }
  ],
  "correct_answer": [
    "A"
  ],
  "solution": {
    "text": "<p>Given&nbsp;<math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mi>f</mi><mfenced><mi>x</mi></mfenced><mo>=</mo><msubsup><mo>&#8747;</mo><mn>0</mn><msup><mi>x</mi><mn>2</mn></msup></msubsup><mfrac><mrow><msup><mi>t</mi><mn>2</mn></msup><mo>-</mo><mn>5</mn><mi>t</mi><mo>+</mo><mn>4</mn></mrow><mrow><mn>2</mn><mo>+</mo><msup><mi>e</mi><mi>t</mi></msup></mrow></mfrac><mi>d</mi><mi>t</mi></math></p><p>We know that,</p><p><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mfrac><mi>d</mi><mrow><mi>d</mi><mi>x</mi></mrow></mfrac><msubsup><mo>&#8747;</mo><mrow><mi>u</mi><mfenced><mi>x</mi></mfenced></mrow><mrow><mi>v</mi><mfenced><mi>x</mi></mfenced></mrow></msubsup><mi>f</mi><mfenced><mi>v</mi></mfenced><mi>d</mi><mi>x</mi><mo>=</mo><mi>f</mi><mfenced><mrow><mi>v</mi><mfenced><mi>x</mi></mfenced></mrow></mfenced><mfrac><mi>d</mi><mrow><mi>d</mi><mi>x</mi></mrow></mfrac><mi>v</mi><mfenced><mi>u</mi></mfenced><mo>-</mo><mi>f</mi><mfenced><mrow><mi>u</mi><mfenced><mi>x</mi></mfenced></mrow></mfenced><mfrac><mi>d</mi><mrow><mi>d</mi><mi>x</mi></mrow></mfrac><mi>u</mi><mfenced><mi>x</mi></mfenced></math></p><p>Using&nbsp;above formula we get&nbsp;<math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><msup><mi>f</mi><mo>&#39;</mo></msup><mfenced><mi>x</mi></mfenced><mo>=</mo><mfenced><mfrac><mrow><msup><mi>x</mi><mn>4</mn></msup><mo>-</mo><mn>5</mn><msup><mi>x</mi><mn>2</mn></msup><mo>+</mo><mn>4</mn></mrow><mrow><mn>2</mn><mo>+</mo><msup><mi>e</mi><msup><mi>x</mi><mn>2</mn></msup></msup></mrow></mfrac></mfenced><mo>&#183;</mo><mn>2</mn><mi>x</mi></math></p><p>For critical points&nbsp;<math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><msup><mi>f</mi><mo>&#39;</mo></msup><mfenced><mi>x</mi></mfenced><mo>=</mo><mn>0</mn></math></p><p>So,&nbsp;<math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mfrac><mrow><mi>x</mi><mfenced><mrow><msup><mi>x</mi><mn>2</mn></msup><mo>-</mo><mn>1</mn></mrow></mfenced><mfenced><mrow><msup><mi>x</mi><mn>2</mn></msup><mo>-</mo><mn>4</mn></mrow></mfenced></mrow><mrow><mn>2</mn><mo>+</mo><msup><mi>e</mi><msup><mi>x</mi><mn>2</mn></msup></msup></mrow></mfrac><mo>=</mo><mn>0</mn></math></p><p><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mo>&#8658;</mo><mi>x</mi><mfenced><mrow><mi>x</mi><mo>+</mo><mn>1</mn></mrow></mfenced><mfenced><mrow><mi>x</mi><mo>-</mo><mn>1</mn></mrow></mfenced><mfenced><mrow><mi>x</mi><mo>+</mo><mn>2</mn></mrow></mfenced><mfenced><mrow><mi>x</mi><mo>-</mo><mn>2</mn></mrow></mfenced><mo>=</mo><mn>0</mn></math></p><p>Now by first derivative test we get,</p><p><img src=\"assets\\st0076_3e42511310a6.png\" style=\"width: 300px; height: 41px;\" /></p><p>Here points of maxima are <math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mfenced close=\"}\" open=\"{\"><mrow><mo>-</mo><mn>1</mn><mo>,</mo><mn>1</mn></mrow></mfenced></math>&nbsp; &amp;&nbsp;points of minima are <math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mfenced close=\"}\" open=\"{\"><mrow><mo>-</mo><mn>2</mn><mo>,</mo><mn>0</mn><mo>,</mo><mn>2</mn></mrow></mfenced></math></p>"
  }
